flowchart TD
    A[Shared closed-candle market data] --> B[EMA9/VWAP primary discovery]
    B --> C{Fresh and valid?}
    C -- No --> D[Rank as stale/insufficient; no authorization]
    C -- Yes --> E[EMA50 secondary context + institutional evidence]
    E --> F{Unified entry authority approves?}
    F -- No --> G[Record WHY-NO-ENTRY evidence]
    F -- Yes --> H[Submit through TradeExecutionService]
    H --> I{Actual exchange fill confirmed?}
    I -- No --> J[Remain pending/reconcile/recovery hold]
    I -- Yes --> K[Initialize LiveTradeManager + profit brain]
    K --> L[Measure price move, leveraged ROE, account return, net realized PnL separately]
    L --> M{Risk/profit/regime decision}
    M -- Protect --> N[Verified native SL / breakeven / runner protection]
    M -- TP1 --> O[Verified reduce-only partial close quantity]
    M -- TP2 --> P[Verified reduce-only/full close quantity]
    M -- Hold --> Q[Continue managed position with updated evidence]
    N --> R[Exchange verification + journal event]
    O --> R
    P --> R
    Q --> R
    R --> S{State reconciled?}
    S -- No --> J
    S -- Yes --> T[Authoritative decision record: evidence, risk, execution, verification]
